@startuml F5.19-ERRO-01-feature-flag
title F5.19-ERRO-01 — Feature flag desativada (404)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "TaskController" as Ctrl

Sec -> WebApp: /secretaria/tarefas
note right of WebApp
  guard: flag off
end note
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /tasks
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
note right of Ctrl
  tasks.enabled=false
end note
Ctrl --> WebApp: 404
WebApp --> Sec: redirect dashboard

@enduml
